{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id25656853"}, "name":{"label":"jimbomorrison"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-09-30T01:25:16-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.5.9"}, "id":{"label":"10422430745"}, "title":{"label":"Perfect."}, "content":{"label":"If you want to build good habits then this app is perfect. \n\nI’ve tried lots of habit trackers over the years and love the Seinfeld approach to keeping going… \n\n… but by augmenting this approach with what geeks would recognise as the git-commit graph, it makes it so easy to map progress, observe weekly habits, track things you might not normally do some days and so-on. \n\nLove it Sabastian. Thanks!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=6443918070&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
