{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id599424743"}, "name":{"label":"fsantiago04"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-06-16T13:17:09-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.5.2"}, "id":{"label":"10040884447"}, "title":{"label":"Favourite productivity app"}, "content":{"label":"Decided to write my first review because of how much this app helped me. I’ve always struggled with managing tasks and the organisation of tasks itself just worsens it so an app like this which is straight to the point really helped. I like the design aesthetic and the layout isn’t overwhelming, and the fact I only need to use it for a minute a day makes it easy to maintain.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=6443918070&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id1259759978"}, "name":{"label":"bdhdhdhajzbfbd"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-06-05T04:44:52-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.5.1"}, "id":{"label":"10001495366"}, "title":{"label":"App is Great but has a few bugs"}, "content":{"label":"Thanks for the application, motivates me well, you’ve done a great job.\n\nThere are a few bugs I’m looking at every day.\n1. iPhone Pro Max 14 - when I launch an application, it instantly exits. I updated to latest version - nothing changed. Check this, please.\n2. When I reinstalled an application - all my habits were deleted. Eventually I checked that I need to manually do the export/import of the data, but that would be great if the habits were automatically saved, or at least if I decide to delete an app, I would like to be asked if I want to store the habits somewhere.\n\nThanks in advance 🙏🙏", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=6443918070&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
